<h2 class='greeting'>Hello {{username}}! 👋</h2>

<p class='message'>
  Welcome to ChatApp! We're excited to have you on board. To complete your registration and start
  connecting with friends, please verify your email address using the OTP code below.
</p>

<div class='otp-section'>
  <span class='otp-label'>Your verification code:</span>
  <div class='otp-code'>{{otp}}</div>
  <p class='otp-expiry'>This code will expire in {{expiry}}</p>
</div>

<p class='message'>
  Enter this code in the verification screen to activate your account. If you didn't create an
  account with ChatApp, please ignore this email.
</p>

<div class='security-note'>
  <h3>🔒 Security Tip</h3>
  <p>Never share your verification code with anyone. ChatApp will never ask you for your password or
    verification codes via email.</p>
</div>

<div class='divider'></div>